<前言><![CDATA[]]></前言>
<法規內容>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 1</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[These standards are enacted in accordance with the provisions the Paragraph 2 of Article 7 of the Health Food Control Act and Article 10 of the Charges and Fees Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 2</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The standards for charging fees to register health food are as follows:
1.The preliminary review fee shall be NT$ 160,000 per application.
2.The secondary review fee shall be NT$ 340,000 per application.
3.The review fee charged for amendment or extension of the registration certificate shall be NT$ 12,000 per application.
4.The review fee charged for reissuance, replacement or transference of the registration certificate shall be NT$ 16,000 per application.
5.The fee charged for a certificate shall be NT$ 2,000 each.
6.The fee charged for an English Certificate shall be NT$ 2,000 each for original copy and NT$ 100 each for duplicate.
Each application for amendment of the registration certificate in subparagraph 3 of the preceding paragraph shall be the different contents in the same registration certificate or the same item with the same contents in different ones.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 3</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[These standards shall be implemented from January 1, 2025.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
</法規>
